> Tip: Your legal name is locked once you are verified. To change it, call or message us. To change your email, open Profile, Sign-in and press **Change my email**: we send a link to the new address and tell the old one, and the email changes when the link is opened.

## Sign in with your phone number

No password needed: we text you a 6-digit code from the CarmaCars number.

1. On `carmacars.ca/sign-in`, press **Use my phone number instead**.
2. Enter your mobile number and press **Text me a code**. Codes go to Canadian mobile numbers.
3. Type the 6-digit code from the text (on most phones it fills itself in), or press **Sign in**. The code works for 5 minutes; **Send a new code** after a minute if it did not arrive.
4. To sign in by phone every time, open **Account** > **Profile**, press **Add and verify my phone number**, enter the code we text you, then choose **My phone number (a code by text)** under Sign in with. The sign-in page then opens on your phone number.

> Tip: New here? On Create account, press Sign up with my phone number instead: your name, your mobile number and the code. An account made by phone has no email yet: you can send requests, accept offers and sign, and the pay page asks for your email before your first payment, for the receipts. A booking request you sent earlier with the same mobile number is added to your account once the code is checked.

## Texts or email: how we reach you

Choose Email, Text or Both. Texts are short, come from the CarmaCars number and link to the page.

1. Open **Account** > **Profile**. Under **Messages**, choose **Email**, **Text** or **Both**. It is saved at once.
2. Texts go to the phone you verified with a code (Sign-in, above). Until you verify one, we email you.
3. Signed agreements, statements and receipts are always emailed when we have your email. On Text you also get a text with a link to view or download them.
4. No texts from 9 pm to 8 am, except urgent ones such as a late return. Reply STOP to any text to stop texts (we confirm with one text); text START to turn them back on.

> Tip: You can also choose in the booking request (How should we reach you?) and when you sign up with your phone number, where Text is chosen for you.


## Rewards

Open **Rewards** in your account.

1. Every rental earns 1 point per dollar of the rental charge when it closes. 100 points are worth $1 off the rental charge of a later booking.
2. More ways to earn are listed on the page: refer a friend with your link (you both get points at their first rental), follow us, review your rental on carmacars.ca, review us on Google (press **I posted my review** and give the name on it), a damage-free rental, your birthday and your first rental.
3. **Get my code** turns points into a code of your own, from 500 points. Type it in the promo code box of your request. An unused code can be given back for the points.
4. Your tier comes from the points you earned in the last 12 months (using points never lowers it): **Gold** from 1,000 points gives Instant Book (your request is booked at once), **Platinum** from 15,000 gives **Any car, any time** (request a car even on dates it shows as taken; we answer within 4 hours), **Black** from 60,000 gives one free rental day a year as a code. Each tier keeps the perks below it. The bar shows how many points to the next tier.
5. **Your discounts** lists every code you hold (from points, your tier, referrals, our team, the free day): what it gives, when it ends, and whether it is unused, on a request or used, with **Copy**. When you send a request, tap the code under **Use a saved discount**.
6. Points end 12 months after your last rental or redemption. We email you a month before.

## Your trip in your calendar or wallet

On a confirmed booking, **Add to calendar** adds the pickup and the return. The confirmation email has the same link. **Add to Apple Wallet** shows when it is available.

## Phone alerts

Get an alert on your phone or computer when your offer is ready, before pickup and return, for payments and when we message you, even with CarmaCars closed.

1. Open **Account** > **Profile**. Under **Phone alerts**, press **Turn on alerts** and allow notifications when your browser asks.
2. Under **What to alert me about**, untick anything you do not want. Your choice applies to all your devices.
3. Press **Send a test alert** to see one. **Turn off on this device** stops them there; **Remove** takes another device off.

On iPhone and iPad, add CarmaCars to your Home Screen first: in Safari tap **Share**, then **Add to Home Screen**. Open CarmaCars from your Home Screen, sign in and turn alerts on in Profile (iOS 16.4 or later).

> Good to know: Alerts come as well as your emails and texts, never instead of them. Alerts that are not urgent wait until 8 am. Sign-in links and codes never come as alerts.

## Delete my account

1. Open **Profile** and scroll to **Delete my account**.
2. Press **Delete my account**, add a reason if you like, then **Yes, delete my account**.
3. We settle anything still open (a rental, a deposit), delete your account and email you within 30 days. Changed your mind before then? Press **Keep my account**.

> Good to know: We keep rental agreements, receipts and tax records as the law requires. Everything else, including your licence and selfie photos, is deleted.

## Odometer and fuel at pickup and return

When you check the car in or out yourself:

1. Add a photo of the dashboard (the odometer and the fuel gauge). It can come from your camera roll. We read it and ask, for example, "Odometer 45,210 km, fuel 3/4: correct?". Press **Yes, correct**, or **No, I will type it** and type the odometer and pick the fuel level.
2. Take a selfie in front of the car with your camera.

After the return, **Your return: km and fuel** on your booking shows the km driven, the km included and any km over, the fuel compared with pickup, and the charge for each. The photo report shows both dashboard photos.

## Earn reward points

Review your rental (add a photo for extra points), review us on Google, follow us from your Rewards page, refer a friend, and every rental after your first earns points too. See them all on **Rewards**.

## Rewards and fuel (release 35)

- Earn points for a photo with your review and for every rental after your first; every way to earn is on your Rewards page.
- A fuel shortfall at the return is priced from the car''s tank and the local pump price, plus a refuelling fee, and checked by our team before any charge.',
  '<p class="gd-p">We check the car with you at the return. Your deposit balance comes back, and your receipts and agreement stay in your portal.</p><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-the-return-and-your-deposit" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">The return and your deposit</h2><ul class="gd-ul"><li>At the return we check the odometer, fuel or charge, keys and cleanliness, take photos and compare with pickup. You sign on our screen.</li><li>The photo report of the pickup and the return is in your email, in Documents and on your booking (<b class="gd-ui">Photo report</b>): the times, the kilometres, the fuel, every photo and any damage. A late return, kilometres over the allowance or less fuel than at pickup are charged from these readings.</li><li>We release the deposit balance after you return the car. If a toll, ticket or claim is still open, we may hold back what we expect it to cost for a while.</li><li>Your statement appears under Documents.</li></ul></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-review-your-trip" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Review your trip</h2><p class="gd-p">After the return we send you a link by email or text. It takes about a minute, and we help you write it.</p><div class="gd-stepblock"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open the link. Tap what you liked: the car, the pickup or delivery, communication, the price, cleanliness, how easy booking was, or the name of the person who helped you.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">If you like, tap the stars for how it felt, and write one sentence in your own words.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Your review appears, made only from what you picked and wrote and the facts of your booking. Change anything you like.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Post on Google</b>: it copies your review and opens Google. Choose your stars and paste it. <b class="gd-ui">Copy</b> only copies it.</div></li></ol></div><p class="gd-p">Already left a review? Press &quot;I already left a review&quot; and we stop asking. Something wasn&#39;t right? The page offers to tell us directly. We never offer anything for a review, and every renter gets the same link.</p></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-review-your-rental-on-our-site" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Review your rental on our site</h2><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t">Open the trip under Past trips, then press <b class="gd-ui">Review your rental</b>. Liked the car? <b class="gd-ui">Book again</b> opens it for new dates.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t">Tap the stars. Add a title and a few words if you like. Both are optional.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t">Tick <b class="gd-ui">Show my review on the site with my first name</b> only if you agree to it being shown.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">4</span><div class="gd-t">Press <b class="gd-ui">Send my review</b>.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/account/bookings/CC-10004/review</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/672"><img src="/guides/img/renter-14-review-desktop-c6c61830.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="672"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:25%;top:33.6%" aria-hidden="true">2</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:3.5%;top:84.5%" aria-hidden="true">3</span><span class="gd-pin" style="left:18.1%;top:92.4%" aria-hidden="true">4</span></div></div></figure></div></section><section class="gd-task" id="after-your-trip-documents-and-your-account" data-gd-task><h2 class="gd-h2">Documents and your account</h2><p class="gd-p">The menu has four links: <b class="gd-ui">Trips</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Documents</b>, <b class="gd-ui">Rewards</b> and <b class="gd-ui">Account</b>.</p><div class="gd-stepblock gd-stepblock--below"><div class="gd-stepcol"><ol class="gd-ol"><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">1</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Documents</b>: your agreements, receipts, statements and uploads. Press <b class="gd-ui">View</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Download</b>.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">2</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Profile</b>: your contact details (<b class="gd-ui">Save</b>), sign-in, drivers and your Card on File.</div></li><li><span class="gd-n" aria-hidden="true">3</span><div class="gd-t"><b class="gd-ui">Account</b> &gt; <b class="gd-ui">Notifications</b>: notices from us. Use <b class="gd-ui">Mark as read</b> or <b class="gd-ui">Mark all as read</b>, and choose which optional emails you get. A number on <b class="gd-ui">Account</b> in the menu is how many notices you have not read.</div></li></ol></div><figure class="gd-fig gd-fig--desk"><div class="gd-browser"><div class="gd-bar" aria-hidden="true"><i></i><i></i><i></i><span class="gd-addr">carmacars.ca/account/documents</span></div><div class="gd-imgwrap" style="aspect-ratio:1440/560"><img src="/guides/img/renter-15-documents-desktop-fd428a63.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async" width="1440" height="560"><span class="gd-pin" style="left:91.8%;top:35.7%" aria-hidden="true">1</span></div></div></figure></div><aside class="gd-box"><span class="gd-lbl">Tip</span><div>Your legal name is locked once you are verified. To change it, call or message us. To change your email, open Profile, Sign-in and press <b class="gd-ui">Change my email</b>: we send a link to the new address and tell the old one, and the email changes when the link is 